{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"weak"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"id<MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate>"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"delegate"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The delegate is responsible for responding to significant changes during the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshotting process, such as the style loading. Implement a delegate to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customize the style that is depicted by the snapshot."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You set the delegate after initializing the snapshotter but before receiving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot, typically before starting the snapshot. The snapshotter keeps a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weak reference to its delegate, so you must keep a strong reference to it to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"ensure that your style customizations apply."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"delegate","fragments":[{"text":"delegate","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"delegate"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapSnapshotter(py)delegate","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/